Package: libzello0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Zello Channel API client library
 A C client library for the Zello Channel API (WebSocket + JSON
 control plane, binary Opus audio). Supports Zello Friends & Family
 (zello.io) and Zello Work (zellowork.io). One channel per client,
 full duplex. Thread-safe API with a lock-free SPSC PCM ring on the
 transmit path and refresh-token reconnect.

Package: libzello-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libdevel
Depends: libzello0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Zello Channel API client library (development files)
 Headers and pkg-config file needed to build programs that link
 against libzello. The library implements the Zello Channel API
 over WebSocket (native + OpenSSL) with Opus audio (libopus) and JSON
 control plane (libcjson).
